* CHARMM Parameters for inorganic phosphate; taken from Yang et al, 2003, PNAS
* 9/28/07

read rtf card append
* c27 na model compounds
*
31  1


RESI P_1        -1.00    ! phosphate, anionic
GROUP                    ! 

ATOM O1   ON4    -0.720  !                H1
ATOM P1   P       1.250  !                 \
ATOM O2   ON4    -0.720  !                 O1
ATOM O3   ON3    -0.795  !                  |
ATOM O4   ON3    -0.795  !          (-)O3--P1==O4(-)
ATOM H1   HN4     0.390  !                  |
ATOM H2   HN4     0.390  !                 O2
                         !                   \
                         !                    H2
                         !                       
BOND P1   O1     P1   O2    P1   O3    P1   O4    O1   H1  O2   H2

! IC TABLE TAKEN FROM THAT OF A DIPHOSPHATE
IC H1   O1  P1   O4  0.0000    000.00     60.0     000.00    0.0000
IC H1   O1  P1   O3  0.0000    000.00    -60.0     000.00    0.0000
IC O1   P1  O2   H2  0.0000    000.00    180.0     000.00    0.0000

PATC  FIRS NONE LAST NONE

END